<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Chinese (Simplified), a draft not yet read by a fluent reviewer (#495). The notes on each string are in values/strings.xml.
    "Vehicle" is 车辆; "route" is 线路; "run" is 班次 (a timetabled departure); "trip" is 行程; "stop" is 站 (站点 on its own);
    "block" is 路牌 (the operators' word for one vehicle's chain of runs in a day); "agency" is 运营单位;
    "dispatcher" is 调度; "report" is 上报, counted with 条 ("已上报 142 条"); "status card" is 状态卡;
    on time / late / early are 准点 / 晚点 / 提前; "diagnostics" is 诊断信息.
    The driver is addressed as 你. Chinese has one plural form, "other". Placeholders are set off from Chinese
    text by a space, as Android's own Chinese strings do.
-->
